### Test Distance Calculation API

# Test geocoding a single address
GET https://localhost:7048/api/distance/geocode?address=New York, NY

###

# Test distance calculation between two addresses
GET https://localhost:7048/api/distance/calculate?origin=New York, NY&destination=Los Angeles, CA

###

# Test distance calculation with more specific addresses
GET https://localhost:7048/api/distance/calculate?origin=123 Main Street, New York, NY&destination=456 Oak Avenue, Los Angeles, CA

###

# Test with nearby addresses
GET https://localhost:7048/api/distance/calculate?origin=Central Park, New York&destination=Times Square, New York

###

# Test cache statistics (requires admin authentication)
# First login as admin
POST https://localhost:7048/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@logistictracker.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### (After login, use the cookie for admin endpoints)

# Get cache statistics
GET https://localhost:7048/api/distance/cache-stats

###

# Clear cache
POST https://localhost:7048/api/distance/clear-cache

###

# Test driver recommendations with real distance (requires admin authentication)
GET https://localhost:7048/api/shipments/{shipment-id}/driver-recommendations?priority=Distance

###